# Biscuit, found at last (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Biscuit

== offer ==
Mrrrow.
Biscuit looks at you, then at your shoes, then at you again. [whisper]...Mrp.[/whisper]
> Pick him up. -> carried [set cat_found]
> Leave him be. -> leave

== carried ==
Biscuit goes limp as a loaf of bread in your arms. [i]Purrrr.[/i]
Time to take him home.

== leave ==
Mrrp. [i]He yawns and licks a paw.[/i]
